  // divider and icons are all reused ("use"); nothing is cut from this mockup any more. The two
  // panels, the title divider and the back, create-room and enter-room icons are the generated kit
  // (ArtSource/Kit/Panels.map.csv, Decor.map.csv, Icons.map.csv; an icon's "opacity" is the one at
  // which the kit's black ink reads as this mockup's ink); the hairline between the header buttons
  // is a drawn shape ("make"). The faint mountains above each card's button are the kit's overlay
  // (UI/Decor/Deco_MountainFooter.png, rects from Decor.map.csv): the generated panel's own
  // mountains sit in its bottom corners, which these short cards hide behind their buttons.
  "name": "PlayWithFriends",
